Package: spaced-meta
Version: 8.26.1
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Spaced Linux Team
Depends: base-files
Provides: spaced-release
Breaks: base-files (<< 13)
Replaces: base-files (<< 13)
Description: Spaced Linux release version tracking
 Tracks the Spaced Linux release version so that in-place OS updates
 are delivered through the package repository. The installed version is
 written to /etc/os-release, and upgrading this package upgrades the
 reported Spaced Linux version to match the release.
